<v J.j. Nelson>My wife is a millionaire. She's a nymphomaniac. And she's an alcoholic. And it's all I can do to handle her. I can't put up with you.
<v J.j. Nelson>我的妻子是百万富翁。她是性欲亢进者。而且她是酒鬼。我能对付她就不错了。我没法忍受你。

00:58:33.930 --> 00:58:56.680
